{
  "info": {
    "name": "RetailStock API",
    "description": "Colección de la API de RetailStock (inventario y ventas).\n\n1. Ejecuta una petición de **Auth › Login**: el script de pruebas guarda el JWT en `{{token}}`.\n2. El resto de peticiones heredan la autenticación Bearer de la colección.\n\nVariables: `baseUrl` (http://localhost:5080/api directo a la API, o http://localhost:3000/api a través de nginx), `token`, `productId`, `saleId`.\n\nSe puede ejecutar completa con el Collection Runner o con Newman: `npx newman run docs/postman/RetailStock.postman_collection.json`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:5080/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "saleId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "userId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "API viva",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Conexión a SQL Server",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"La BD existe\", () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().databaseExists).to.be.true);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health/db",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "health",
                "db"
              ]
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login Admin",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Devuelve token\", () => pm.expect(json.token).to.be.a(\"string\"));",
                  "// Guarda el token: todas las peticiones de la colección lo envían como \"Authorization: Bearer {{token}}\"",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set(\"token\", json.token);",
                  "console.log(`Sesión: ${json.email} (${json.role})`);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@retailstock.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin123!\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "description": "Inicia sesión como admin@retailstock.com y guarda el JWT en la variable {{token}}."
          }
        },
